  "remarks": "Joint Stock Company “Aluminium Metallurg Rus” is a major Russian enterprise producing specialised aluminum alloy forgings and profiles for high-load structural applications critical to Russia’s military and industrial complex. The company maintains major direct supply contracts exceeding USD 166,8  million with Russian defence manufacturers subject to restrictive measures including Tupolev JSC, JSC Production Association “Strela”, JSC Rocket and Space Centre “Progress”, Stupinsky Trade House LLC, JSC Khrunichev Center, and the All-Russian Scientific Research Institute of Aviation Materials.",
